{
    "title": "Carly \u2014 OBD2 car scanner",
    "description": "Carly is the most versatile OBD2 solution, offering diagnostics, engine live data, and guides for car repair and maintenance.\r\nIt's helped over a million car owners to save up to $2,000 per year for car-related topics.\r\n\r\nGet the Carly app and the Carly Universal Scanner to access data through the OBD2 port of your car.\r\n\r\nUnleash your inner car hero with Carly!\r\n\r\nIt works for Audi, BMW, Ford, Lexus, Mercedes, Mini, Opel, Porsche, Renault, Seat, Skoda, Toyota, VW, and almost all other car brands with an OBD2 port.\r\n\r\nAs every car is unique, which specific Carly features are available will vary with every model, build year, hardware, and software.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nBASIC FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE (FREE) BASIC PACKAGE\r\n\r\nDiagnostics (OBD), Live Data (OBD), and Emission Check (OBD) enable you to have control over the most important systems \u2014 engine and transmission.\r\n\r\nADVANCED FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE PREMIUM PACKAGE (YEARLY LICENSE)\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 UNDERSTAND YOUR CAR'S HEALTH\r\nWith Carly Diagnostics, you can read and clear fault codes from all built-in electronic control units (ECUs), including engine, transmission, ABS, airbag, and multimedia, keep track of your car\u2019s health, gauge the severity of problems, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 POWERCHARGE YOUR REPAIR SKILLS\r\nGet expert repair guides for your specific issues to help you understand and fix the issues by yourself.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 MONITOR ENGINE LIVE DATA\r\nLive parameters or live data can help you take the guesswork out of understanding what your car needs and narrow down the fault causes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 PERFORM CAR MAINTENANCE INDEPENDENT OF THE WORKSHOP\r\nThe Carly Maintenance feature helps you step-by-step to service your car yourself, reset your service and keep track of your service intervals directly from your phone.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 VIEW THE CONDITION OF YOUR BATTERY\r\nThe Carly Battery Check function helps you monitor the status of your car's starter battery, which will help to increase your batterie lifetime.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 CODE AND UNLOCK HIDDEN FEATURES\r\nAccess hidden features set by the manufacturer and customize your car to fit your needs. This feature is only available on certain car brands/models, and the coding options vary between each control unit.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 DETECT MILEAGE MANIPULATION\r\nMileage manipulation is on the rise. Don\u2019t get tricked when buying a used car \u2014 use Carly to perform a used car inspection before buying.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\n\r\nStep 1: Check which features are available for your car model\r\nStep 2: Order your Carly Universal Scanner\r\nStep 3: Plug the scanner into the OBD2 port and log in on this app\r\n\r\nTHE CARLY UNIVERSAL SCANNER \u2014 THE MOST ADVANCED OBD DEVICE\r\n\r\nThe OBD2 device was designed to support almost all car brands with an OBD2 port and to enable advanced Carly features. The scanner comes with:\r\n\u2022 A lifetime warranty\r\n\u2022 Premium customer support\r\n\r\nTake the health of your car into your own hands!\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nYou can purchase a subscription for an individual car brand or for all car brands.\r\nThis is a yearly subscription. The subscription automatically renews for one year if not canceled at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. The subscription can be managed in your purchases and the automatic renewal can be deactivated there.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://bit.ly/35Mxg5s\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://bit.ly/35Rruze",
    "descriptionHTML": "Carly is the most versatile OBD2 solution, offering diagnostics, engine live data, and guides for car repair and maintenance.<br>It&#39;s helped over a million car owners to save up to $2,000 per year for car-related topics.<br><br>Get the Carly app and the Carly Universal Scanner to access data through the OBD2 port of your car.<br><br>Unleash your inner car hero with Carly!<br><br>It works for Audi, BMW, Ford, Lexus, Mercedes, Mini, Opel, Porsche, Renault, Seat, Skoda, Toyota, VW, and almost all other car brands with an OBD2 port.<br><br>As every car is unique, which specific Carly features are available will vary with every model, build year, hardware, and software.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>BASIC FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE (FREE) BASIC PACKAGE<br><br>Diagnostics (OBD), Live Data (OBD), and Emission Check (OBD) enable you to have control over the most important systems \u2014 engine and transmission.<br><br>ADVANCED FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE PREMIUM PACKAGE (YEARLY LICENSE)<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 UNDERSTAND YOUR CAR&#39;S HEALTH<br>With Carly Diagnostics, you can read and clear fault codes from all built-in electronic control units (ECUs), including engine, transmission, ABS, airbag, and multimedia, keep track of your car\u2019s health, gauge the severity of problems, and more.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 POWERCHARGE YOUR REPAIR SKILLS<br>Get expert repair guides for your specific issues to help you understand and fix the issues by yourself.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 MONITOR ENGINE LIVE DATA<br>Live parameters or live data can help you take the guesswork out of understanding what your car needs and narrow down the fault causes.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 PERFORM CAR MAINTENANCE INDEPENDENT OF THE WORKSHOP<br>The Carly Maintenance feature helps you step-by-step to service your car yourself, reset your service and keep track of your service intervals directly from your phone.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 VIEW THE CONDITION OF YOUR BATTERY<br>The Carly Battery Check function helps you monitor the status of your car&#39;s starter battery, which will help to increase your batterie lifetime.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 CODE AND UNLOCK HIDDEN FEATURES<br>Access hidden features set by the manufacturer and customize your car to fit your needs. This feature is only available on certain car brands/models, and the coding options vary between each control unit.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 DETECT MILEAGE MANIPULATION<br>Mileage manipulation is on the rise. Don\u2019t get tricked when buying a used car \u2014 use Carly to perform a used car inspection before buying.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>HOW IT WORKS<br><br>Step 1: Check which features are available for your car model<br>Step 2: Order your Carly Universal Scanner<br>Step 3: Plug the scanner into the OBD2 port and log in on this app<br><br>THE CARLY UNIVERSAL SCANNER \u2014 THE MOST ADVANCED OBD DEVICE<br><br>The OBD2 device was designed to support almost all car brands with an OBD2 port and to enable advanced Carly features. The scanner comes with:<br>\u2022 A lifetime warranty<br>\u2022 Premium customer support<br><br>Take the health of your car into your own hands!<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>You can purchase a subscription for an individual car brand or for all car brands.<br>This is a yearly subscription. The subscription automatically renews for one year if not canceled at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. The subscription can be managed in your purchases and the automatic renewal can be deactivated there.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://bit.ly/35Mxg5s<br>Privacy Policy: https://bit.ly/35Rruze",
